@startuml
!include ../../../../plantuml/sodexo-theme.puml

title The solution exposes purpose-built APIs while keeping supplier complexity behind an adapter
caption Solid paths are synchronous HTTPS/JSON; the event rail carries versioned Kafka contracts.

top to bottom direction
hide stereotype

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 34
skinparam ranksep 44
skinparam ArrowColor SODEXO_MUTED
skinparam ArrowFontColor SODEXO_MUTED
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam rectangle {
  FontSize 13
  BorderThickness 1.5
  RoundCorner 16
  Padding 15
}

rectangle "<color:#2B3797><b>CHANNELS</b></color>\nB2C Accommodation Lego  ·  Operator Console  ·  Corporate / Sodexo Admin" as Channels #F5F6FC

rectangle "<color:#2B3797><b>REUSED PLATFORM EDGE</b></color>\nAPI Gateway  ·  Authentication  ·  Tenant and role access control  ·  Rate limits" as Edge #DDE1F6

rectangle "<color:#2B3797><b>ACCOMMODATION EXPERIENCE API</b></color>\n<color:#5F6685>CHANNEL-FACING REST APIs</color>\nTraveller API  ·  Operator API  ·  Administration API" as Experience #FFFFFF

rectangle "<color:#2B3797><b>ACCOMMODATION SERVICE</b></color>\n<color:#5F6685>DOMAIN & REFERENCE APIs</color>\nDestinations · policy evaluation\nSearch · availability" as Accommodation #FFFFFF

rectangle "<color:#2B3797><b>BOOKING WORKFLOW SERVICE</b></color>\n<color:#5F6685>COMMAND & WORKFLOW APIs</color>\nRequests · approvals · clarifications\nBook · amend · cancel" as Workflow #FFFFFF

rectangle "<color:#2B3797><b>REPORTING SERVICE</b></color>\n<color:#5F6685>QUERY & EXPORT APIs</color>\nOperations · spend · compliance\nReports · exports" as Reporting #FFFFFF

rectangle "<color:#2B3797><b>RECONCILIATION SERVICE</b></color>\n<color:#5F6685>OPERATIONS APIs</color>\nExceptions · retries\nEvidence · resolution" as Reconciliation #FFFFFF

rectangle "<color:#ED1C24><b>BOOKING.COM INTEGRATION SERVICE</b></color>\n<color:#5F6685>SUPPLIER ADAPTER APIs</color>\nSearch · availability\nOrder preview · create · manage" as SupplierAdapter #FBDADD

rectangle "<color:#ED1C24><b>BOOKING.COM</b></color>\nDemand API" as BookingCom #FFF4DD
rectangle "<color:#2B3797><b>ENTERPRISE SYSTEMS</b></color>\nESB · Finance · Notifications" as Enterprise #F5F6FC

rectangle "<color:#187A5A><b>VERSIONED EVENT APIs · KAFKA</b></color>\nRequestSubmitted  ·  ApprovalDecided  ·  BookingConfirmed / Failed  ·  InvoiceMatched  ·  ReconciliationResolved" as Events #DDF2E9

Channels -down-> Edge
Edge -down-> Experience

Experience -down-> Accommodation
Experience -down-> Workflow
Experience -down-> Reporting
Experience -down-> Reconciliation

Accommodation -[hidden]right-> Workflow
Workflow -[hidden]right-> Reporting
Reporting -[hidden]right-> Reconciliation

Accommodation -down-> SupplierAdapter
Workflow -down-> SupplierAdapter
SupplierAdapter -down-> BookingCom
Reconciliation -down-> Enterprise

BookingCom -[hidden]right-> Enterprise
BookingCom -[hidden]down-> Events
Enterprise -[hidden]down-> Events

@enduml
